    "heading": "Level 10: Heightened Focus",
    "lineStart": 3287,
    "lineEnd": 3295
  },
  "section": "3.149",
  "rulesText": "Your Flurry of Blows, Patient Defense, and Step of the Wind gain the following benefits.\n\nFlurry of Blows. You can expend 1 Focus Point to use Flurry of Blows and make three Unarmed Strikes with it instead of two.\n\nPatient Defense. When you expend a Focus Point to use Patient Defense, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to two rolls of your Martial Arts die.\n\nStep of the Wind. When you expend a Focus Point to use Step of the Wind, you can choose a willing creature within 5 feet of yourself that is Large or smaller. You move the creature with you until the end of your turn. The creature's movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks."
}
